  "releaseNotes": "## 2.0.0-beta.32 - 2026-09-07\n\n- Blocks new messages while the selected sandbox template is preparing or\n  failed, including rebuilds triggered by upgrades and manual changes; an old\n  usable fallback no longer bypasses the readiness gate\n- Keeps chat readiness current through a lightweight status endpoint, replacing\n  the entire composer during preparation and restoring it after activation\n- Reuses the same server-side gate for Codex, OpenCode, published APIs and the\n  external SDK; existing Runs and approval responses remain unaffected\n- Activates a manually prepared default template after draining existing Runs,\n  and rechecks the selected provider and configuration before activation\n- Reuses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.13`; no Runtime image or Harness dependency changes\n\n### Verification\n\n- Passed production build, type checks and all 414 automated tests\n- Verified a real Cube rebuild with an old usable template: chat composer\n  replacement and navigation recovery, with both Harness message endpoints\n  rejecting new requests during preparation",
